  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The issue is likely to occur when someone spawns their drone while you already have one deployed. There’s a high likelihood of some collision occurring with your drone—even when other drones are far apart—which can result in your drone being knocked far away and, at the same time, a possible chance of your client crashing.\n\nEDIT: Probably also likely to occur if someone's drone spawns in the same location occupied by yours.",
